### Pruebas de la API (VS Code con la extensión "REST Client", o copia a Postman)
@base = http://localhost:3001/api

### Estado
GET {{base}}/health

### Login correcto -> copia el "token" de la respuesta
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "1234" }

### Login incorrecto -> 401
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "mala" }

### Pega aquí el token
@token = PEGA_EL_TOKEN

### Suma
POST {{base}}/sum
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "num1": 5, "num2": 7 }

### Calculadora
POST {{base}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "expresion": "(2+3)*4" }

### Sin token -> 401
POST {{base}}/sum
Content-Type: application/json

{ "num1": 1, "num2": 2 }

### Logout
POST {{base}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
